{"product_id":"smok-novo-2-replacement-pods","title":"SMOK NOVO 2 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK NOVO 2 Replacement Pods are a trio of 2mL plastic pod cartridges designed for the SMOK Novo 2, the successor of the original Novo, offering a 1.0ohm Mesh and 1.4ohm MTL options that will extract the best flavor from the loaded eJuice. Featuring a side fill system stoppered by a silicone stopper, the NOVO 2 Replacement Pods come in a pack of three to provide a few flavor options or as replacement pods to change out a spent pod. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK Novo Pod, Features :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes with 2ml capacity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 pieces each pack.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports easy side filling system.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531769946167,"sku":"69d25d4be7566","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-novo-2-replacement-pods.jpg?v=1741709995","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2-replacement-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




